doing so, we have been poisoning ourselves, and our pets.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color: #000000; font-family: \'arial\'; font-size: 14px; line-height: initial;\\\">By breathing this recirculated air our pets and ourselves are ingesting the contaminants released by the Volatile Organic Compounds (VOCs), we bring inside. Air Fresheners, odor eliminators, cleaning products, and personal care items are all known cancer-causing VOCs.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color: #000000; font-family: \'arial\'; font-size: 14px; line-height: initial;\\\"> Further, we have been inundated with outside toxins finding their way into our homes then being trapped there. These include \\u2013 Molds\\/Mycotoxins, Neurotoxins, Red Tide, and Radon<\\/span><span style=\\\"color: #000000; font-family: arial; font-size: 14px; text-align: inherit; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: -0.015em;\\\">.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color: #000000; font-family: \'arial\'; font-size: 14px; line-height: initial;\\\"> All of these outside influences including basic allergens greatly affect our pets.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#333333\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-10\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"aa308e9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"READ MORE\",\"align\":\"left\",\"background_color\":\"#024D25\",\"hover_color\":\"#000000\",\"button_background_hover_color\":\"#EEEEEE\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"4\",\"right\":\"4\",\"bottom\":\"4\",\"left\":\"4\",\"isLinked\":true},\"text_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"12\",\"right\":\"40\",\"bottom\":\"12\",\"left\":\"40\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":