widget\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#024D25\",\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-77\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"d896e69\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<em><span style=\\\"color: #000000; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: -0.27px;\\\">Since the energy crisis in the \\u201870s, we have built our homes tighter to conserve energy.<\\/span><\\/em>\",\"text_color\":\"#222222\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-50\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"15\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_background_background\":\"classic\",\"_background_color\":\"#EEEEEE\",\"_border_border\":\"solid\",\"_border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"5\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_border_color\":\"#024D25\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"0689c8a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color: #000000; font-family: \'arial\'; font-size: 14px; line-height: initial;\\\">In doing so we continually breathe the recirculated air inside our homes. It has taken over 40 years for the building industry, EPA, and CDC to realize that by doing so, we have been poisoning ourselves, and our pets.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color: #000000; font-family: \'arial\'; font-size: 14px; line-height: initial;\\\">By breathing this recirculated air our pets and ourselves are ingesting the contaminants released by the Volatile Organic Compounds (VOCs), we bring inside. Air Fresheners, odor elim