\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"fabe53a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/bsa1\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/services1.jpg\",\"id\":176,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":28,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"fee9430\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/bsa1\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/09\\/services2.jpg\",\"id\":177,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":36}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"16a167e\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#EDF3F8\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c6fc3fa\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b07282c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div><span style=\\\"color: #1f1f1f; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal;\\\">These deficient methods of cooking are responsible for indoor air pollution (IAP) and poor health of women as well as young children who are often exposed to such a polluted environment [2]. Biomass and coal smoke carry a wide range of harmful pollutants such as Particulate Matter (PM), Nitrogen Dioxide (NO2), Carbon Monoxide (CO), Sulphur Oxides, polycyclic organic matter, and formaldehyde [3, 4].<\\/span><\\/div>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"60\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":90,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
