(1602, 285, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"fa2313c\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c9f02f6\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"82bebcb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>[smartslider3 slider=\\\"3\\\"]<\\/p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"048493c\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9f589e3\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8ef3478\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p class=\\\"text-uppercase\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 30px;\\\">AN INSIGHT INTO<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"text_color\":\"#1F1F1F\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Roboto\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"7fcf905\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h5 style=\\\"font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.1; color: #1f1f1f; margin: 0px 0px 15px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal;\\\">Answers you need to know<\\/h5>\\n<div><\\/div>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-55\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"align\":\"left\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"c59acbd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"align\":\"left\",\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#024D25\",\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-50\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"d34b93e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]},\"align\":\"left\",\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#024D25\",\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-64\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"6e9d552\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":10,\"sizes\":[]},\"align\":\"left\",\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#024D25\",\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-78\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"81ad1cc\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"structure\":\"20\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-90\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"fb43379\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3cdc681\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h5 style=\\\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); margin: 10px 0px 15px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">1:Who?<\\/span><\\/h5>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"db88321\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h5 style=\\\"font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: #333333; margin: 10px 0px 15px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start;\\\">We are a group of indoor air quality experts who have decided to address the significant rise in pet related illnesses including lung cancer. We have experts in building science, toxicology, mechanical ventilation, as-built construction, and doctors, physicians, and other specialists that evaluate environments such as yours.<\\/h5>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-25\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"d1432c6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h5 style=\\\"font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: #333333; margin: 10px 0px 15px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: bold;\\\">2: Why the rise in lung cancer for our pets?<\\/span><\\/h5>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-25\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"28ac9a5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h5 style=\\\"font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: #333333; margin: 10px 0px 15px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start;\\\">Do you remember your Grandma\\u2019s house? She had windows that you could actually \\u2018feel\\u2019 a draft coming in? This lack of insulation and poor design would allow for the air inside her home to \\u201cchange\\u201d with that outside air about 20 to 30 times a day. Our pets were healthier back then. For the last 50 years we\\u2019ve been building tighter insulated homes, homes that are more energy efficient. In doing so that average home in Southwest Florida has only two to three \\u201cchanges\\u201d air changes a day! Quite a difference? Ever cook food on the stove and you can still smell that aroma days later? That because our air isn\\u2019t being replaced and our animals are breathing that same air over and over.<\\/h5>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-25\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"fe99918\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"00e69bd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h5 style=\\\"font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: #333333; margin: 10px 0px 15px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: bold;\\\">1:Why?<\\/span><\\/h5>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"44a9d77\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h5 style=\\\"font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: #333333; margin: 10px 0px 15px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start;\\\">We are a group of indoor air quality experts who have decided to address the significant rise in pet related illnesses including lung cancer. We have experts in building science, toxicology, mechanical ventilation, as-built construction, and doctors, physicians, and other specialists that evaluate environments such as yours.<\\/h5>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-25\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"f4e7d16\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h5 style=\\\"font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: #333333; margin: 10px 0px 15px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: bold;\\\">4:Did you know?<\\/span><\\/h5>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-25\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"8ec0ba7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h5 style=\\\"font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: #333333; margin: 10px 0px 15px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start;\\\">That the air quality in your home changes all the time? Depending on the time of day, month and year your homes air quality changes in many ways. That why we are committed to testing the environment and air quality in homes just like yours across Southwest Florida. We developed a testing panel unique to your home while considering those factors and others such as Red-tide, Humidity levels, Mycotoxin\\u2019s and Allergy season, to name a few.<\\/h5>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-25\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"62bf20d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h5 style=\\\"font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: #333333; margin: 10px 0px 15px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: bold;\\\">5: So\\u2026 IS MY PET AT RISK?<\\/span><\\/h5>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-25\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"7d4e731\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h5 style=\\\"font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: #333333; margin: 10px 0px 15px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start;\\\">Find out now\\u2026 get a free initial risk assessment right away. Fill out the e